'''Thunderblood Mace''' is a version of [[Nord Mace]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[blunt]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

An upgraded Nord Mace will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Mace.

